<title>FRANCE: Lagardere, Thomson-CSF suspended.</title>
<headline>Lagardere, Thomson-CSF suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Stock Markets Association SBF said it had suspended share trading in Lagardere Groupe and Thomson-CSF pending an imminent statement.</p>
</text>
